              (width (schedule k)) n ξ ζ‖ ^ 2 ≤
            (10 + 8 * ((Q : ℝ) / (B : ℝ))) *
                dSVDensityRationalPhysicalProjectorCrossHazard
                  N (width (schedule k)) ξ ζ +
              (4 * ε ^ 2 +
                16 * (Real.exp (((B : ℝ) + 1) / (Q : ℝ)) - 1) +
